# Cascade Delete

Khi 1 entity owner bi xoa, cac entity lien quan phai duoc xoa theo cascade.

## Pattern

- Su dung JPA cascade + database FK ON DELETE CASCADE.
- Tranh orphan record bang cach:
  - Set orphanRemoval = true cho quan he parent-child (vd Cart -> CartItem).
  - Dung database FK constraint voi ON DELETE CASCADE.
  - Su dung Spring Event (@PreRemove, ApplicationEvent) de xoa resource ngoai DB (vd Cloudinary image).

## Cac quan he cascade

### User -> Address, Cart, Image (USER)

- Khi user bi xoa: addresses (user_id), carts (user_id), images (owner_type=USER, owner_id) phai bi xoa cascade.
- Wallet bi xoa theo (neu khong con lich su giao dich). Neu con lich su -> soft delete user, khong xoa cung.

### Store -> Product, WarehouseAddress, Image (STORE), Voucher (store), Wallet

- Khi store bi xoa (hoac soft delete): products, addresses (store_id), images, vouchers phai bi xoa cascade.
- Product -> FlashSaleItem: chi cascade neu chua co order tham chieu.
- Product -> Image (PRODUCT, VARIANT): cascade.

### Cart -> CartItem

- Khi cart bi xoa: cart_items phai bi xoa (orphanRemoval = true).
- Khi xoa user: cart cua user cung bi xoa cascade.

### Order -> OrderItem, Payment, VoucherUsage, WalletTransaction

- Khi order bi xoa: order_items, payments, voucher_usages phai bi xoa cascade.
- WalletTransaction KHONG nen xoa (audit) - chi set order_id = NULL hoac giu lai.

### FlashSaleSlot -> FlashSaleItem

- Khi slot bi xoa: items phai bi xoa cascade.
- FlashSaleItem KHONG cascade xoa neu da co order tham chieu.

### Image cleanup (orphaned)

- Khi owner bi xoa, image phai bi xoa ca record trong DB + file tren Cloudinary.
- Su dung Spring Event:
  - User/Store/Product/Variant/Review bi xoa -> publish event ImageCleanupEvent.
  - ImageEventListener nhan event -> xoa file Cloudinary + record trong images.

## Quy tac

- Moi cascade deu phai duoc kiem tra 2 lop:
  - DB level: FK ON DELETE CASCADE hoac trigger.
  - JPA level: cascade = CascadeType.REMOVE hoac orphanRemoval = true.
- Soft delete (status = INACTIVE) khong cascade xoa - chi an giao dien.
- Khi hard delete, dam bao cleanup resource ngoai (Cloudinary, Redis, file).
- Test cascade bang integration test voi Testcontainers.

## Khi them entity moi

- Xac dinh cac quan he cascade (vd Category -> Product khong nen cascade neu con product).
- Cap nhat migration voi FK constraint phu hop.
- Cap nhat Entity voi cascade attribute.
- Viet test cascade.